Watch your art come to life — literally. Every drawing now records its own making-of: open the editor menu and tap "Watch replay" to scrub through your drawing's history stroke by stroke, at 15, 30, or 60 seconds. Then "Share timelapse" renders it as a crisp video, with your finished animation playing at the end — ready for Instagram, TikTok, Discord, or anywhere else. Also fixes the color picker on some devices.
